    <item>
      <title>万斯在对犹太保守派的讲话中为反犹太主义的态度辩护</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/vance-republican-jewish-committee.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[副总统 JD 万斯在私下讲话中解释了他为何与一些被指控反犹太主义的影响者交往。他还敦促观众帮助阐明为什么与以色列建立牢固的关系符合美国的利益。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/01/us/politics/vance-republican-jewish-committee.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 06:33:06 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
